  "name": "Tunnel Load Simulator - SmartTunnel project",
  "description": "A vectorized Monte Carlo generator of synthetic electrical load profiles for road tunnels. The tool models lighting, ventilation and auxiliary power demand as a function of tunnel geometry, traffic patterns, and stochastic disturbances such as pollution episodes and accidents. Developed as part of the SmartTunnel research project.",
